  "summary": "Soniox has released Soniox STT v6, the latest generation of its speech-to-text API. Soniox STT v6 is a speech-to-text model that reads what a voice agent says while hearing the caller. It uses that text to recognize short replies and to drop the agent’s own voice. The release ships as stt-rt-v6 for streaming and stt-async-v6 […] The post Soniox STT v6 Adds Agent Text Input and Echo Filtering for Voice Agents appeared first on MarkTechPost .",
